 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "Somewhere on your feed there's a person",
   "startFrame": 11,
   "endFrame": 51
  },
  {
   "text": "crying into a bowl of Korean noodles.",
   "startFrame": 52,
   "endFrame": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "That's Buldak.",
   "startFrame": 109,
   "endFrame": 133
  },
  {
   "text": "Four thousand four hundred Scoville.",
   "startFrame": 134,
   "endFrame": 188
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the part Koreans find funny about that.",
   "startFrame": 199,
   "endFrame": 257
  },
  {
   "text": "This is a cheongyang pepper.",
   "startFrame": 258,
   "endFrame": 305
  },
  {
   "text": "It lives in the fridge,",
   "startFrame": 306,
   "endFrame": 331
  },
  {
   "text": "it gets sliced raw into soup,",
   "startFrame": 332,
   "endFrame": 376
  },
  {
   "text": "and it starts at ten thousand.",
   "startFrame": 377,
   "endFrame": 417
  },
  {
   "text": "So the noodle the whole internet is frightened of doesn't get halfway",
   "startFrame": 418,
   "endFrame": 500
  },
  {
   "text": "to a pepper somebody's grandmother drops into a stew without thinking about it.",
   "startFrame": 501,
   "endFrame": 606
  },
  {
   "text": "Which makes you wonder what Koreans are actually buying,",
   "startFrame": 615,
   "endFrame": 678
  },
  {
   "text": "and it isn't the famous one.",
   "startFrame": 679,
   "endFrame": 708
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Jin Ramen.",
   "startFrame": 709,
   "endFrame": 740
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty-six percent of the country,",
   "startFrame": 741,
   "endFrame": 779
  },
  {
   "text": "and the mild version is mild enough",
   "startFrame": 780,
   "endFrame": 828
  },
  {
   "text": "that five-year-olds eat it.",
   "startFrame": 829,
   "endFrame": 862
  },
  {
   "text": "That's deliberate, not an accident.",
   "startFrame": 863,
   "endFrame": 914
  },
  {
   "text": "And if you've ever been handed",
   "startFrame": 923,
   "endFrame": 956
  },
  {
   "text": "free ramyun in a Korean restaurant,",
   "startFrame": 957,
   "endFrame": 1003
  },
  {
   "text": "it was this brand.",
   "startFrame": 1004,
   "endFrame": 1039
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time.",
   "startFrame": 1040,
   "endFrame": 1077
  },
  {
   "text": "Ottogi held the price still for thirteen years,",
   "startFrame": 1078,
   "endFrame": 1140
  },
  {
   "text": "so it quietly became the cheapest",
   "startFrame": 1141,
   "endFrame": 1185
  },
  {
   "text": "bag in Korea to give away.",
   "startFrame": 1186,
   "endFrame": 1232
  },
  {
   "text": "Korea isn't eating for the burn.",
   "startFrame": 1233,
   "endFrame": 1271
  },
  {
   "text": "It's just eating dinner.",
   "startFrame": 1272,
   "endFrame": 1312
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a lot more of this.",
   "startFrame": 1320,
   "endFrame": 1343
  },
  {
   "text": "Every Korean ramyun, ranked, on epickor.com.",
   "startFrame": 1347,
   "endFrame": 1412
  }
 ]
